<title>SOUTH KOREA: Kumho &amp; Co Inc first half net falls.</title>
<headline>Kumho &amp; Co Inc first half net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				     206 vs 341</p>
<p>    Net					    3.03 vs 5.05</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			  4.26 vs 5.05</p>
<p>    Turnover				   603.04 vs 608.56</p>
<p>Note - Kumho &amp; Co Inc is one of South Korea's leading tyre makers and a unit of the Kumho Group. The figures were released by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
</text>
